  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6603.04 Placarding. All vehicles transporting high-level radioactive waste pursuant to RSA 107-D and these rules shall be placarded as required by 49 CFR 172.\n\nSource. #7287, eff 5-24-00; ss by #9154, eff 5-8-08",
